      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Goal: take one sentence and send it with the user's time zone.\nSends: POST /api/act { input, timeZone }  (max 500 characters)\nServer runs one action at a time so the task list cannot change mid-run.",
      "originalText": "Goal: take one sentence and send it with the user's time zone.\nSends: POST /api/act { input, timeZone }  (max 500 characters)\nServer runs one action at a time so the task list cannot change mid-run.",
