      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Goal: pull a short summary and the time, date and location from the text.\nReturns: { summary, time HH:MM, date YYYY-MM-DD, location,\n           missing_labels }   (not found = null, and listed as missing)\nChecks: real calendar date, missing_labels = exactly the nulls;\none retry with the errors, else all labels missing. Delete skips this.",
